<title>UK: IBRD sets 300 billion lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>IBRD sets 300 billion lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BCI and JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND</p>
<p>DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.95 PCT  MATURITY    21.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.725   PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS UK/US/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
